<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <%- include('head', { title: 'Choisir un espace — Amir Academy' }) %>
</head>
<body class="landing auth-page">
    <%- include('navbar', { showTeacher: true, showLogin: false }) %>

    <div class="landing-bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="blob blob-blue"></span>
        <span class="blob blob-yellow"></span>
        <span class="blob blob-blue2"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-split" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; align-items:center;">
        <div class="landing-card landing-left auth-card" style="max-width: 980px; width: min(980px, 100%); text-align:center;">
            <div class="py-badge">
                <img src="/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_81m0sb81m0sb81m0.jpeg" alt="Amir Academy logo" />
            </div>
            <h1 class="landing-title">Choisis ton <span class="accent">espace</span></h1>
            <p class="auth-sub" style="text-align:center;">Accède à la plateforme selon ton profil.</p>

            <div class="choice-grid">
                <a class="choice-card" href="/teacher">
                    <div class="py-badge">
                        <img src="/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_81m0sb81m0sb81m0.jpeg" alt="Espace enseignant" />
                    </div>
                    <h2>Espace enseignant</h2>
                    <p>Gère les classes, ajoute des élèves et découvre le tableau de bord.</p>
                    <span class="choice-link">Ouvrir</span>
                </a>

                <a class="choice-card" href="/eleve">
                    <div class="py-badge">
                        <img src="/images/Gemini_Generated_Image_81m0sb81m0sb81m0.jpeg" alt="Espace élève" />
                    </div>
                    <h2>Espace élève</h2>
                    <p>Entre ta clé et ton identité pour accéder à l'éditeur et coder.</p>
                    <span class="choice-link">Ouvrir</span>
                </a>
            </div>

            <a class="auth-back" href="/">&#8592; Retour à l'accueil</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
